animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thread necromancy! <br /> <br /> I had an idea of my own for weresquirrels: the Ratatoskar. They were created as saboteurs, misinformants, spies, and deep-cover agents (depending on auspice, which is season-based). At least in my chronicle, they waited out the Wars of Rage in Umbral boltholes, but when they returned the Get exterminated them within a century.</div> </div> </div> </div>When I read the first post I immediately also thought of naming em Ratatoskr! I was thinking maybe the Arboreal in betweener fera, like a land version of Camzotz and Corax.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}